  english:
    title: F Type Fire Estinguisher
    message: F-type fire extinguishers are used for cooking oil fires. They work
      by forming a layer over the oil surface, preventing re-ignition. Water must
      never be used, as it can intensify the fire.
    sound: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 48503612e59634049b590cc66d1e00b1, type: 2}
  turkish:
    title: "F Tipi Yang\u0131n T\xFCp\xFC"
    message: "F tipi yang\u0131n t\xFCpleri, k\u0131zg\u0131n ya\u011F yang\u0131nlar\u0131nda
      kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Ya\u011F\u0131n \xFCzerini kaplayarak yang\u0131n\u0131
      bo\u011Far ve yeniden alevlenmeyi \xF6nler. Su ile m\xFCdahale edilmesi yang\u0131n\u0131
      b\xFCy\xFCtece\u011Finden kesinlikle kullan\u0131lmamal\u0131d\u0131r."
    sound: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0a57c50a0c83f8c469b01762d0a86fe4, type: 2}
